Minimal *-types.defs stubs for the pygtk-style code generator in
moo/moopython/codegen/.

pygobject-3.0 does not ship the .defs files that pygtk-2.0 did, and does not
advertise a defsdir through pkg-config, so there is nothing on the system to
point --register at.  These hand-written placeholders declare just the few
fundamental types moo.defs refers to.

They live here, in the repository, because the alternative was worse: the
build used to interpolate an empty PYGTK_DEFS_DIR, producing
--register "/gio-types.defs", and only worked on machines where someone had
created those files at the filesystem root.
